{"seq":1,"slug":"errors-and-logs-as-agent-feedback","title":"Errors And Logs As Agent Feedback","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/observability-and-errors-for-agents/errors-and-logs-as-agent-feedback","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"self-correction-needs-signal","title":"自我纠错需要信号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/observability-and-errors-for-agents/errors-and-logs-as-agent-feedback/self-correction-needs-signal","wordCount":2337,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"what-agents-read-to-debug","title":"Agent 调试时读什么","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/observability-and-errors-for-agents/errors-and-logs-as-agent-feedback/what-agents-read-to-debug","wordCount":2229,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"observability-in-the-ai-age","title":"AI 时代的可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/observability-and-errors-for-agents/errors-and-logs-as-agent-feedback/observability-in-the-ai-age","wordCount":1848,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章讲清错误、日志、可观测信号对 agent 的根本意义:它们是 agent 的反馈与感官。agent 自我纠错靠的是信号——它做了一件事,要靠错误/日志/可观测的状态知道结果对不对、哪错了,没有信号它就只能瞎猜、停在&quot;应该对吧&quot;。agent 调试一个问题时,读的正是这些:报错、堆栈、日志、状态——这些清不清晰、拿不拿得到,决定它能不能定位。而在 agent 大量自主工作的 AI 时代,可观测性的意义升级了:它不再只是给运维看的仪表盘,而是 agent 理解系统、自我纠错的感官——系统越能说清自己的状态,agent 就越能自己看懂、自己修。</p>\n"}